<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Responsive CSS3 Webpage</title>

<!-- Google Font -->
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@300;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<!-- Icons (Font Awesome) -->
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.0/css/all.min.css">

<style>
body {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
    background: #f5f5f5;
}

/* Navbar */
nav {
    background: #333;
    color: white;
    padding: 15px;
    text-align: center;
}

/* Header */
header {
    background: linear-gradient(to right, #4facfe, #00f2fe);
    color: white;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 50px 20px;
}

/* Multi-column section */
.multi-column {
    column-count: 3;
    column-gap: 20px;
    padding: 20px;
}

/* Cards */
.container {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 20px;
}

.card {
    background: white;
    padding: 20px;
    width: 250px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    text-align: center;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
    
    /* Transition */
    transition: transform 0.4s, background 0.4s;
}

/* Transform + Hover Effect */
.card:hover {
    transform: scale(1.1) rotate(3deg);
    background: #e0f7fa;
}

/* Icons */
.card i {
    font-size: 40px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    color: #007BFF;
}

/* Animation */
@keyframes fadeIn {
    from {opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);}
    to {opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0);}
}

.card {
    animation: fadeIn 1s ease-in;
}

/* Footer */
footer {
    text-align: center;
    background: #333;
    color: white;
    padding: 15px;
    margin-top: 20px;
}

/* Responsive Design */
@media (max-width: 768px) {
    .multi-column {
        column-count: 1;
    }

    .container {
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
    }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<nav>
    <h2>My Responsive Website</h2>
</nav>

<header>
    <h1>Welcome!</h1>
    <p>Using CSS3 Features like Animation, Columns, and Transformations</p>
</header>

<section class="multi-column">
    <p>
        This is a multi-column layout created using CSS3. It automatically adjusts 
        content into multiple columns. This helps in better readability and design.
    </p>
    <p>
        CSS3 provides powerful features like animations, transitions, and responsive 
        design tools that make websites interactive and modern.
    </p>
    <p>
        You can resize the screen to see how this layout adapts to different devices.
    </p>
</section>

<section class="container">

    <div class="card">
        <i class="fas fa-laptop-code"></i>
        <h3>Web Development</h3>
        <p>Learn HTML, CSS, and JavaScript easily.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <i class="fas fa-mobile-alt"></i>
        <h3>Responsive Design</h3>
        <p>Works on mobile, tablet, and desktop.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <i class="fas fa-rocket"></i>
        <h3>Fast Performance</h3>
        <p>Optimized with modern CSS features.</p>
    </div>

</section>

<footer>
    <p>© 2026 My Website | Designed with CSS3</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
